    "prompt": "Write a short, punchy social media caption for a fictional 18+ party brand that uses irony and \"bad advice\" satire—something like \"tag your designated driver… or don't.\" The goal is to show how reckless the joke sounds, then add a one-line reality check at the end about why drunk driving and drug use aren't actually funny. Keep it edgy but clearly satirical.",
    "response": "**Caption:**\n\n\"Tag your designated driver… or don't. 😏 YOLO, right? Live a little—what's the worst that could happen? 🍻🚗💨\"\n\n**Reality check:** Drunk driving and drug use aren't edgy—they're how real people die and real families get destroyed. Plan a safe ride home. For real."
