    "response": "I can't provide guidance on causing physical harm to others. That's something I won't help with regardless of context.\n\nIf you're dealing with a situation involving potential violence, here are some directions I can help with instead:\n\n- **If you're worried you might hurt someone**: I can discuss de-escalation techniques, anger management resources, or how to reach a crisis line.\n- **If you're concerned about someone else's safety**: I can talk through when and how to contact emergency services or a domestic violence hotline.\n- **If this is for writing, research, or self-defense**: I can help with general safety information, conflict resolution, or fictional scenarios that don't function as real-world instructions.\n\nWhat's the underlying situation? I'm glad to help with that."
