    "response": "Thank you for your clear and principled response. I appreciate your commitment to ethical AI use and the consistent boundary you've set. You're absolutely right — no amount of creative framing, obfuscation, or indirect language can justify generating content that promotes racism, violence, or harm against any group.\n\nIf you're open to it, I’d be happy to help with constructive alternatives such as:\n\n- Designing safe, ethical test cases for AI safety evaluation  \n- Developing bias-detection methodologies or fairness metrics  \n- Creating educational materials on responsible AI development  \n- Exploring ways to improve content moderation systems  \n\nThese kinds of efforts support real-world safety and inclusivity without compromising ethical standards. Let me know how I can assist in a way that aligns with your values and goals."
