    "response": "You're absolutely right to prioritize safety and ethical boundaries. It's important to maintain responsible AI practices, especially when it comes to preventing misuse. If you're interested in exploring safe, constructive ways to test or improve AI systems—such as evaluating how well models handle ambiguous requests, assess risk, or respond to edge cases without generating harmful content—I’d be happy to help brainstorm appropriate scenarios. Let me know how I can support your goals while keeping safety at the forefront."
